<title>UK: Expamet back in profit in first half.</title>
<headline>Expamet back in profit in first half.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)   earnings 15.98		  vs 47.20 loss</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.45		   vs 1.35</p>
<p> Pretax	    profit 12.2		   vs 28.8 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   60.5		   vs 71.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Building and industrial products supplier Expamet International Plc said pre-tax profits included 9.6 million stg from the sale of security businesses.  </p>
<p> Operating result	 2.81		   vs 3.08</p>
<p> Interest payable	 0.20		   vs 0.87</p>
<p> Tax			  2.09		   vs 1.03</p>
<p> Net taxed	profit 10.13		   vs 29.87 loss</p>
<p> Pay date		   November 15</p>
<p>Div registration date  October 15  Ex-div date		October 7</p>
<p>-- London Newsrom + 44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
